{"title":"Sohcahtoa","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Sohcahtoa</b> is a useful mnemonic to remember how to find the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sine\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sine\">sine</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cosine\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cosine\">cosine</a>, and the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Tangent\" title=\"Tangent\">tangent</a> of angles in a triangle. It translates to, \"Sine: opposite over hypotenuse, Cosine: adjacent over hypotenuse, Tangent: opposite over adjacent.\"\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sohcahtoa&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Trigonometry\" title=\"Trigonometry\">Trigonometry</a></li></ul>\n<p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Sohcahtoa&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018110618\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 12/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 268/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.101      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    6.101      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2456:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018110618 and revision id 262438. Rendering was tri